Sisay, Weatherlight Captain in BGRUW, built to Bracket 3 rules. This guide is a starting point generated from the decklist — the sections below group what the deck actually contains by what each card is there to do.

# The commander
Sisay, Weatherlight Captain :: Sisay gets +1/+1 for each color among other legendary permanents you control.

# Game Changers (3 of 3)
Rhystic Study :: Whenever an opponent casts a spell, you may draw a card unless that player pays {1}.
Smothering Tithe :: Whenever an opponent draws a card, that player may pay {2}. If the player doesn't, you create a Treasure token.
The One Ring :: When The One Ring enters, if you cast it, you gain protection from everything until your next turn.

# Taxes and lock pieces
Lavinia, Azorius Renegade :: Each opponent can't cast noncreature spells with mana value greater than the number of lands that player controls.
Kutzil, Malamet Exemplar :: Your opponents can't cast spells during your turn.
Timeless Lotus :: Timeless Lotus enters tapped.

